      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-08-03_WidnesExaminer_art0020" n="art0020">
        <head>DAINTY SUMMER BRETELLES.</head>
        <p>DAINTY SUMMER BRETELLES.</p>
        <p>In spite of their long run of popularity during the last few months; bretelles remain just as fashionable as ever they were, and are greatly in demand for wear over light summer blouses and frocks. The charming example pictured *in our sloetch is particularly smart and summery in appearance; and as it can be manufactured from sale remnants it is possible of achievement at very small cost. Tho bretelles are cut with wide pendent kimono sleeves attached, both being</p>
