        <p>An individual applies to the cab company for a situation. "Do you know how to drive?" "Yes, sir." "You know that you must he polite with all your passengers?" "Ahl" "And honest. For example, whet would you do if you should find in your cab a pocket- book containing 0,000 t" "Nriming 3' U. I should live on my income."</p>
        <p>Jolly.—A dinner party—the yo Inge?- gentle- man (it is his first visit) has broken Ole ice at last by inquiring the name of the hostess' little daughter, to which the child has replied, "Ethel." "And why, Ethel, do you keep patting me on the arm?" "Because mamma says you're a ;muff"—(awful pause, during which the child strokes him down)—"but yo 4 don't feel like one, you know."</p>
