        <head>Examiner, Saturday, August 3, 1907. I LOVELt-LANE v. WELFIELD ATHLETIC.—At Mill-lane SCIENCE NOTES AND NEWS. on Saturday. Score :</head>
        <p>The Examiner, Saturday, August 3, 1907. I LOVELt-LANE v. WELFIELD ATHLETIC.—At Mill-lane SCIENCE NOTES AND NEWS. on Saturday. Score :</p>
