        <p>8</p>
        <p>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR.</p>
        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS.</p>
        <p>- - - - Authors of letters intended for publication must in 'all cases send their names and addresses to the Editor as a guarantee of good faith.</p>
        <p>Matter intended for publication must be written on one side only of the paper and sent in, if possible,not ater than Thursday.</p>
