        <p>CRICKET. (Cont.nued from Page 7). WALKER'S BREWERY v. SOUTHPORT POLECE.—The above match was played at Southport on Wednesday 1 and .resulted in an easy win for the visitors. For the winners J. Dargan bowled remarkably well, taking 7 wickets for as many runs, and W. Ashton batted well making 25 before he was stumped. Scores : WALKER'S. SOUTHPORT. J. Cain b Hodgson lO Hamer b Dargan 0 H. Cook run out 3 Ball b Dargan lO G. Pearson c Ball b Murphy lbw b Dargan 4 Hodgson • 2 Pearson b Dargan A. Holland c Pearson b Black b Darean Hodgson • 0 Hodgson b Norman ... 1 W.Norman c tizb Hodgson 1 Leadbetter b Norman 4 J. Dargan c Pearson b Lowe b Dugan o Ball 0 Hoyle a .v.lulloy b W. Ashton at Pearson b Norman 2 Murphy 25 Croft not out W. Baird b Hodgson 6 Smith b Dargan . J. Taylor run out L Turner not out J. Mullov run out 6</p>
